{
  "key": 37946,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "EternaCitySouthHouse_Text_HowIsYourPokedex",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: Ah, it’s you! Good to see you!\n",
        "How is your Pokédex coming along?\r",
        "Capturing every kind of Pokémon is\n",
        "no easy feat, I’ll grant you that.\r",
        "But I’m sure you can accomplish it!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCitySouthHouse_Text_AcquaintanceSentSomething",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: Ah, yes!\r",
        "An acquaintance from Kanto has sent\n",
        "me something quite interesting.\r",
        "I think you’d make better use of it\n",
        "than I ever could.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCitySouthHouse_Text_PokemonThatEvolvesTradingWithUpgrade",
      "en_US": [
        "I understand there is a Pokémon that\n",
        "evolves when it is traded while holding\f",
        "that Up-Grade.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCitySouthHouse_Text_SightingsOfLegendaryBirds",
      "en_US": [
        "Incidentally, and this is an entirely\n",
        "different topic...\r",
        "I’ve heard that there have been\n",
        "sightings of very rare Pokémon.\r",
        "The legendary bird Pokémon: ARTICUNO,\n",
        "ZAPDOS, and MOLTRES!\r",
        "Somewhere very cold, somewhere that\n",
        "generates electricity, and somewhere\f",
        "Trainers gather...\r",
        "If you go to places like those, you\n",
        "may be lucky enough to see them\f",
        "yourself!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCitySouthHouse_Text_LegendaryBirdsExtremelyRare",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: ARTICUNO, ZAPDOS, and MOLTRES\n",
        "are extremely rare even in Kanto.\r",
        "Somewhere very cold, somewhere that\n",
        "generates electricity, and somewhere\f",
        "Trainers gather...\r",
        "So why would they be spotted here in\n",
        "Sinnoh of all places?\r",
        "There are still many, many mysteries\n",
        "surrounding Pokémon, it seems!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCitySouthHouse_Text_YouveCaughtLegendaryBirds",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: Ah, it’s you!\n",
        "How goes it?\r",
        "What’s that? You’ve caught ARTICUNO,\n",
        "ZAPDOS, and MOLTRES?!\r",
        "Now that is incredible!\r",
        "Well, then, allow me to examine your\n",
        "Pokédex.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCitySouthHouse_Text_SovereignClearWings",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: Take a look at the two feathers\n",
        "I have here, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\r",
        "They’re both known as Clear Wings.\n",
        "You might think they look ordinary...\r",
        "But these feathers have a puzzle that\n",
        "I’m currently trying to solve.\r",
        "They may have a connection to the two\n",
        "Pokémon known as the guardians of the\f",
        "sea and sky.\r",
        "LUGIA, the guardian of the sea, is\n",
        "said to mediate between the three\f",
        "legendary birds of Kanto.\r",
        "Maybe this Clear Wing would react to\n",
        "ARTICUNO, ZAPDOS and MOLTRES?\r",
        "Would you bring all three of them\n",
        "here in your party?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCitySouthHouse_Text_SovereignBirdsInParty",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: What’s this? In your party...\n",
        "ARTICUNO, ZAPDOS and MOLTRES?!\r",
        "Now that is incredible!\n",
        "Thank you, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\r",
        "Now, this Clear Wing...\n",
        "Will it react, I wonder?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCitySouthHouse_Text_SovereignOh",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: Oh?!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCitySouthHouse_Text_SovereignSilverWing",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: Ah, splendid! It really did work!\n",
        "This Clear Wing has changed.\r",
        "It’s now a deep silver color...\n",
        "And it’s sparkling, too.\r",
        "It must be the Silver Wing!\r",
        "Thanks for your assistance, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\n",
        "I’d like you to have this Silver Wing.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCitySouthHouse_Text_SovereignLugiaHint",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: Do you know of anywhere in the\n",
        "sea surrounded by small islands?\r",
        "Perhaps you’d somehow find LUGIA there\n",
        "if you carry the Silver Wing with you.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCitySouthHouse_Text_SovereignRainbowClearWing",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: Now, this other Clear Wing...\n",
        "Perhaps it could be the Rainbow Wing?\r",
        "The guardian of the sky was said to\n",
        "have resurrected three Pokémon.\r",
        "RAIKOU, ENTEI and SUICUNE.\n",
        "The legendary beasts of Johto.\r",
        "I’m sure this Clear Wing would respond\n",
        "to the presence of those Pokémon!\r",
        "I would imagine those Pokémon would\n",
        "enjoy high places...\r",
        "Maybe the Rock Climb technique could\n",
        "help you find them?\r",
        "If you somehow catch all three...\n",
        "Please show them to me."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCitySouthHouse_Text_SovereignBeastsInParty",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: In your party...\n",
        "RAIKOU, ENTEI, and SUICUNE?!\r",
        "You’ve done it again, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "Truly impressive!\r",
        "Now, let’s see if this Clear Wing...\r",
        "Oh?!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCitySouthHouse_Text_SovereignRainbowWing",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: Excellent! This Clear Wing is now\n",
        "a sparkling, vibrant rainbow color!\r",
        "This is clearly the Rainbow Wing!\n",
        "How very exciting!\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, thank you again.\n",
        "I’d like you to have this, too.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCitySouthHouse_Text_SovereignHoOhHint",
      "en_US": [
        "Oak: A tall place where the departed\n",
        "are given due respect...\r",
        "There is a place like that in Sinnoh,\n",
        "is there not?\r",
        "Taking a Rainbow Wing to a place like\n",
        "that might allow you to meet HO-OH,\f",
        "the sky guardian."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
